U.S. Fetal Death Harmonization Project
======================================

Two-part licensing
------------------

1. Source data (NCHS National Vital Statistics System fetal death public-use
   files) are works of the United States Government and are not subject to
   copyright protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. § 105). They are
   redistributed here in their original form within the per-year ``yearly_clean``
   parquet files. NCHS use restrictions and confidentiality requirements
   continue to apply; see https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/data_access/restrictions.htm .

2. The harmonization work — including the harmonized and derived parquet files,
   crosswalks, schema, scripts, validation reports, and documentation
   contributed by this project — is licensed under the
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

You are free to:
